				<div class="post-687 post hentry category-software-reviews">
			<h2 id="post-687"><a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/index.php/2007/08/awesome-tool-of-the-day-stumbleupon-firefox-add-on/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Awesome Tool of the Day: StumbleUpon Firefox Add-On">Awesome Tool of the Day: StumbleUpon Firefox Add-On</a></h2>
			<small class="meta">August 1st, 2007 </small>

			<div class="entry">
				<p>The other day&nbsp;I happened&nbsp;upon the <a href="https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/" mce_href="https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/">Firefox Add-On page</a> and decided to give the recommended Add-On a try.&nbsp; I&#8217;ve been infatuated ever since.</p>
<p>Though there&#8217;s an inordinate number of buttons on the default toolbar layout, <a href="http://www.stumbleupon.com/" mce_href="http://www.stumbleupon.com/">StumbleUpon</a>&nbsp;is pretty simple: You/others browse the web and when you find something you like you give it a thumbs-up <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_2.png" mce_href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_2.png" atomicselection="true"><img src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_thumb_2.png" style="border: 0px none ;" alt="image" mce_src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_thumb_2.png" border="0"></a> or a thumbs-down <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_3.png" mce_href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_3.png" atomicselection="true"><img src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_thumb_3.png" style="border: 0px none ;" alt="image" mce_src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_thumb_3.png" border="0" height="17" width="16"></a> if you don&#8217;t.&nbsp; Then there&#8217;s the magic button <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_4.png" mce_href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_4.png" atomicselection="true"><img src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_thumb_4.png" style="border: 0px none ;" alt="image" mce_src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayStumbleUponFirefoxAdd_8956/image_thumb_4.png" border="0" height="18" width="17"></a>&nbsp;which randomly picks pages from the submitted pages that are recommended (thumbs-up).&nbsp; Their pitch says it pretty well&#8230;<i>&#8220;Channel surf the internet.&#8221;</i></p>
<p>I warn you, it is very addictive, but if you choose topics you are actually interested in, you&#8217;ll find quite a few cool and relevant sites.&nbsp; <a href="http://cromwellryan.stumbleupon.com" mce_href="http://cromwellryan.stumbleupon.com">Check out</a> my recommended sites so far..</p>
<p><a href="https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/138" mce_href="https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/138">Get the StumbleUpon Add-On</a></p>
			</div>

